  {
    "id": "bhagavad-gita_17_1",
    "text_slug": "bhagavad-gita",
    "chapter": 17,
    "verse": 1,
    "original": "अर्जुन उवाच |\nये शास्त्रविधिमुत्सृज्य यजन्ते श्रद्धयान्विताः |\nतेषां निष्ठा तु का कृष्ण सत्त्वमाहो रजस्तमः ||१७-१||",
    "transliteration": "arjuna uvāca .\nye śāstravidhimutsṛjya yajante śraddhayānvitāḥ .\nteṣāṃ niṣṭhā tu kā kṛṣṇa sattvamāho rajastamaḥ ||17-1||",
    "meaning": "17.1 Arjuna said  Those who, setting aside the ordinances of the scriptures, perform sacrifice with faith, what is their condition, O Krishna? Is is Sattva, Rajas or Tamas?",
